# MiniTool HQ — Tool Development Rules

Do **not** code a new tool until the build spec exists under `docs/specs/`.  
Do **not** mark a tool shipped until **feature testing** and **SEO gate** both pass.

## Fixed workflow (every tool)

1. **Keyword** — primary SEO keyword + **≥3** secondary long-tails; **Read** `.cursor/skills/minitool-seo-expert/SKILL.md` first (see `minitool-seo-expert.mdc` + `minitool-seo-keywords.mdc`)
2. **Competitors + spec accuracy** — top 3–5 results; feature parity; for **format / size / limits** tools also complete the **bidirectional official + competitor check** (see `minitool-spec-accuracy.mdc`) before locking defaults
3. **Reuse** — search GitHub/npm for MIT/Apache libs. Prefer wrapping existing code
4. **Agent assist** — use competitor-research / web fetch; never skip step 2–3
5. **Spec** — write `docs/specs/NN-tool-slug.md` including full **SEO** block **and** Spec accuracy table when applicable
6. **Build** — client-side only when possible; no upload servers for file tools
7. **Monetize** — **ads only**; **every tool is fully free** (no Pro, no $4.99, no batch paywall)
8. **Ship UI + SEO together** — follow SEO expert skill; tool UI, FAQ, JSON-LD, title/description, homepage link — **same PR / same ship**. No “SEO later”
9. **Feature + SEO test (mandatory)** — every **must** feature + SEO E2E assertions; for size/format tools assert outputs match locked defaults; `npm run build` alone is **not** enough. Record results in the spec **Test log**
10. **Next tool** — only after step 9 passes

## Hard rules

- Self-operated tools first; marketplace later
- No heavy AI wrappers, no PWA-first, no PDF suite on day one
- Match competitor **must-have** features
- **Format / size / limits accuracy** — official docs + core competitors, bidirectional check before ship (`minitool-spec-accuracy.mdc`)
- **Same customer job = one tool** (e.g. one Marketplace Image Prep, not Amazon+TikTok+Etsy clones)
- After implementation: run the tool in a real browser (or automated E2E), with real sample files when the tool processes files
- **Customer copy only** on the live site — see `minitool-customer-copy.mdc`
- **Search discoverability is mandatory** — see `minitool-seo-keywords.mdc` + **must use** SEO expert skill (`.cursor/skills/minitool-seo-expert/SKILL.md`, rule `minitool-seo-expert.mdc`). Cover vertical keywords on the one job page via FAQ/presets

## Testing tooling

- E2E uses **Playwright** (`super-shell` `devDependency`). After clone: `npx playwright install chromium`
- Each tool: `npm run test:<slug>` (e.g. `test:amazon-prep`, `test:fba-box`) must pass before **shipped**
- Site shell (all pages/links/assets): `npm run test:site` must pass before calling a release done
- Record tool results in the tool spec **Test log**
